EbizzPay payment integration for WooCommerce.

== Description ==

Accept payments on WooCommerce using EbizzPay.

== Installation ==

1. Log in to your WordPress admin.
2. Search plugins "EbizzPay for WooCommerce" and click "Install Now".
3. Activate the plugin.
4. Navigate to "Plugins" in the sidebar to access the plugin list page.
5. Find "EbizzPay for WooCommerce", then click "Settings" to access the plugin settings page.
6. Follow the instructions and update the plugin settings.

